# Wild Card (windurst 77): the reply kinds that only another quest's or mission's line shows. Level 5, fame 325,
# Crying Over Onions completed (its new defaults stand: The Promise available), Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way!
# accepted by GM (Kohlo-Lakolo 371, Papo-Hopo 372: Events), The Puppet Master accepted by GM (its 403 on the House of
# the Hero, an Event), Windurst mission 8-2 The Jester Who'd Be King current (Apururu's 588, a Progress line, at
# mission status 0; 589, an Event, at 1). Wild Card accepted by GM at Prog 0, rank 8.
# - Kohlo-Lakolo: 545 (Progress) over 371 (Prog 1). Papo-Hopo: 509 (Event) ties with 372 (both talks; Crying Over
#   Onions' 508 replaceDefault below both).
# - The House of the Hero (_6n2, its script answers nothing here): 386 (Progress) over 403 (Prog 2); the card by GM: 387
#   (Progress) over 403 (the card taken, 8000 gil, Prog 4); Prog 1 and rank 9 by GM: 388 (Progress) over 403 (Prog 3);
#   the card by GM: 389 (Progress) over 403 (Prog 4). An Event line would tie with 403 or give the next talk to the
#   door's script.
# - Apururu (Windurst Woods), Prog 3 by GM: 600 and 588 (both Progress) tie: 588 first (its finish: mission status 1,
#   the Manustery Ring); then 600 (Progress) over 589 (Event), twice. An Event 600 would lose to 588 and tie with 589.
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Papo-Hopo/onTrigger WindurstWalls/_6n2/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Apururu/onTrigger
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-27.5,-8.0,189.6 lvl=5 nation=2
rank 8
fame Windurst 325
quest Windurst.CryingOverOnions completed
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay accepted
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster accepted
mission Windurst TheJesterWhodBeKing current
quest Windurst.WildCard accepted
login
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 545 (Progress) over 371
finish                                         # Prog 1
trigger Papo-Hopo                              # 509 and 372 tie: 372 first
finish
trigger Papo-Hopo                              # 509
finish
warp -24.5,-14.498,262.994 WindurstWalls
trigger _6n2                                   # Prog 1, rank 8: 386 (Progress) over 403
finish                                         # Prog 2
keyitem JokerCard                              # GM
trigger _6n2                                   # Prog 2, the card, rank 8: 387 (Progress) over 403
finish                                         # the card taken; 8000 gil; Prog 4
charvar Quest[2][77]Prog 1                     # GM
rank 9                                         # GM
trigger _6n2                                   # Prog 1, rank 9: 388 (Progress) over 403
finish                                         # Prog 3
keyitem JokerCard                              # GM
trigger _6n2                                   # Prog 3, the card, rank 9: 389 (Progress) over 403
finish                                         # the card taken; 8000 gil; Prog 4
charvar Quest[2][77]Prog 3                     # GM
warp -10.6,-2.75,15.9 WindurstWoods
trigger Apururu                                # 600 and 588 (Progress) tie: 588 first (mission status 1)
finish
trigger Apururu                                # mission status 1: 600 (Progress) over 589 (Event)
finish
charvar Quest[2][77]Prog 3                     # GM
trigger Apururu                                # the same again
finish                                         # 8000 gil; Prog 4
